<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling slips v dollar, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling slips v dollar, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling edged down slightly against the dollar on Wednesday but regained ground against sterling, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 594.5742 compared to Tuesday's 594.4158. Sterling traded at a mean of 977.4830 shillings against 997.8488 on Tuesday.</p>
